E. Is V the ONLY admissible statistic?  The predicate's argument assumes
   coordinates are exchangeable.  A q-ary lattice has k=d/2 distinguished
   coordinates, so the true symmetry group is signed permutations WITHIN
   each block.  W = sum_{a<k} P_aa - beta*k/d is then a DEGREE-1 invariant,
   is not constant, and is not a function of V.
   d=100 b=30 unreduced: W =  +15.00000  (Haar null sd of W = 0.30540) ->    +49.1 null-sd
              V =   +9.32709  (both statistics fire; W is not a function of V)
   d=140 b=30 unreduced: W =  +15.00000  (Haar null sd of W = 0.30834) ->    +48.6 null-sd
              V =   +6.73712  (both statistics fire; W is not a function of V)
